Answer me!

283
00:13:13,470 --> 00:13:14,760
Can't you understand what I'm saying?

284
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,230
How many times do I have to tell you?

285
00:13:28,380 --> 00:13:35,480
♪I'm the one who's broken♪

286
00:13:36,490 --> 00:13:41,200
♪Calm, ordinary, and reckless♪

287
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:44,270
♪That's me, too♪

288
00:13:45,810 --> 00:13:49,330
♪Carefully sketching
and shaping every detail♪

289
00:13:50,160 --> 00:13:53,420
♪Laughter and tears make life feel real♪

290
00:13:54,250 --> 00:13:57,870
♪Don't fear that it's not worth it.
Just be brave♪

291
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,810
♪And learn from your mistakes♪

292
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:05,370
♪If the human heart
is impossible to fathom♪

293
00:14:05,370 --> 00:14:07,620
♪Could selling my soul and body♪

294
00:14:07,620 --> 00:14:10,790
♪Bring me something more?♪

295
00:14:11,410 --> 00:14:18,220
♪Stroke by stroke,
I draw the perfect outline♪

296
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:22,320
♪Sadness is blue♪

297
00:14:23,430 --> 00:14:26,670
♪How would you paint me?♪

298
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:31,400
♪Layering, crossing, blending endlessly♪

299
00:14:31,400 --> 00:14:33,440
♪Painting without restraint♪

300
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:36,440
♪Covering the person I used to be♪

301
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:40,390
♪If I could start over♪

302
00:14:40,800 --> 00:14:44,700
♪I'd show more feeling
in every look and gesture♪

303
00:14:44,700 --> 00:14:47,350
♪Give me back my smile♪

304
00:14:47,910 --> 00:14:50,400
♪Find joy even in hardship♪

305
00:14:50,980 --> 00:14:55,960
♪Don't let the next version of me
be left with nothing♪
